---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
    <style>
      h1 {
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
      <h2>Greetings, Traveller. What do you like?</h2>
      <p>Ale to wash the road-dust down, or something sweet to thaw your tongue?</p>
      <p>You look like you've come far, but every soul who steps through that oak door thinks their journey was the hardest. Let me tell you about the last fellow who sat right where you're sitting now. That was three winters ago, back when the snow piled high enough to bury the second-story windows.</p>

      <p>He was a young mapmaker, all bright-eyed and full of ink-stains, convinced he was going to chart the Whispering Ridge beyond the northern timberline. He had a brass compass that spun like a madman's top and a coat lined with silver fox. I told him the same thing I'm telling you: the mountains don't want to be drawn. They change their shape when you aren't looking.</p>

      <p>He laughed. Ordered a flagon of our strongest blackberry mead, tipped me a silver coin—real silver, mind you, not plated copper—and rode out at first light.</p>

      <p>Do you know what we found when the spring thaw finally came and the shepherds went up the pass?</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
